WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:07.740
Technetium is the first element in the periodic
table which is naturally radioactive, so it

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:15.110
is the lightest radioactive element and so
for a long time very little was known about

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:22.910
it. Now people are beginning to study it in
suitably strong surroundings of ů to contain

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:29.500
the radioactivity and they have discovered
that the chemistry of technetium is in many

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:39.280
ways quite similar to that of rhenium or manganese.
And there are a number of medical treatments

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:49.899
now which use the radioactivity of technetium
in order to trace through the body and look

00:00:49.899 --> 00:00:55.569
at their emissions to find out about different
diseases. And so the chemistry of technetium

00:00:55.569 --> 00:01:00.230
is becoming more important in the medical
role, how to make a compound that you can

00:01:00.230 --> 00:01:04.720
get into the body safely and quickly so that
it can be used for medical purposes.

